  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAWDER-MUKAIRAS-BORDER(YAR) ROAD PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OBJECTIVES OF THE PROJECT IS TO ENSURE A PERMANENT LINK BETWEEN LAWDER_MUKAIRAS AND BORDER WITH YEMEN ARAB REPUBLIC THROUGH AN ALL WEATHER ROAD. THE ROAD WILL CROSS THE PLATEAU OF MUKAIRAS WHICH HAS AN IMPORTANT AGRICULTURAL POTENTIAL. THE PROPOSED ROAD WILL HAVE A TOTAL LENGTH OF APPROXIMATELY 39 KM.</narrative>
  </description>
